            "detailed_description": "We all believe in things we can neither prove they exist, or they don’t.<br />\r\nGods. Fairies. Conspiracies.<br />\r\nThey keep us awake at night. We fear them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMankind has explored every possible extinction scenario.<br />\r\nWars. Disease. Alien invasions. Supernatural forces. We fear them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMankind had its fastest technological progress in recent history.<br />\r\nUncover a dark secret that goes back to the days of the first russian space project.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUser your hacker skills to start uncovering a dark secret, by going through the past from the early days of computers, all the way to the most advanced computers of the future.",
