                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "WARNING: DO NOT BUY unless you hate your sleep schedule!\n\nI bought this game thinking I would just \"quickly check it out\" for 15 minutes.\nIt is now 4:00 AM, my eyes are bleeding, I'm seeing glowing green terminal text when I blink, and the FBI is probably monitoring my smart fridge.\nThanks a lot, developers.\n\n=== The Good ===\n\n• Instant God Complex\nWithin 10 minutes, you'll genuinely believe you can bypass mainframe firewalls and download more RAM.\n\n• Hollywood Accuracy\nPerfectly captures that movie vibe where typing frantically on a keyboard solves global geopolitical crises.\n\n• Atmosphere\nThe immersion is so real I accidentally unplugged my router because I thought a rival script kiddie was tracing my IP.\n\n=== The Bad ===\n\n• Completely ruined my social life.\n(Not that I had one, but still.)\n\n• Does NOT actually teach you how to wipe your student loan data from government servers.\nHighly disappointing.\n\n• My girlfriend left me because I kept calling her a \"low-priority security breach.\"\n\n=== Verdict ===\n\n 10/10 If you want to feel like Neo from The Matrix while sitting in your underwear eating cold pizza, this is your game. Slap that thumbs-up button so the government can't find this review.",
